---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="Research Use Only — Terms of Use for Research Peptides" description="Research Use Only statement: the permitted and prohibited uses of peptides supplied by Made in China Peptide, and buyer responsibilities." canonical="/compliance/research-use-only/">
  <div class="wrap-narrow">
    <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> › Compliance › Research Use Only</p>
    <h1>Research Use Only (RUO) statement</h1>
    <div class="note"><strong>All products supplied by {site.brand} are for laboratory research use only.</strong> They are not drugs, foods, cosmetics, dietary supplements or veterinary products. They are not intended for human or animal use, diagnosis, treatment, cure or prevention of any disease.</div>

    <h2>Permitted use</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>In-vitro laboratory research by qualified institutions and companies</li>
      <li>Analytical method development and reference-standard work</li>
      <li>Formulation research by cosmetic and pharmaceutical R&amp;D teams (where local law permits)</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Prohibited use</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Administration to humans or animals in any form</li>
      <li>Resale as a drug, supplement, food or cosmetic product</li>
      <li>Any diagnostic, therapeutic or clinical application</li>
      <li>Use by persons under 21 or by unqualified consumers</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Buyer responsibility</h2>
    <p>Buyers confirm they are at least 21 years old, are acquiring material for legitimate research or trade purposes, and will comply with the laws of their jurisdiction. Buyers are responsible for verifying that the products are legal to import and possess in their country.</p>

    <h2>No medical advice</h2>
    <p>Nothing on this website constitutes medical advice. We do not provide dosing information, treatment guidance or recommendations for human use. Consult a licensed medical professional for any health question.</p>

    <p class="small muted">Last updated: 2026-11-04</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
